<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Consent Renewal Required - {{clubName}}</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #333;
      background-color: #f4f4f4;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 20px auto;
      background: #fff;
      border-radius: 8px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
    }
    .header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #F59E0B 0%, #D97706 100%);
      color: #fff;
      padding: 35px 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .header h1 {
      margin: 0 0 8px 0;
      font-size: 26px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .header .icon {
      font-size: 48px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .header p {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 15px;
      opacity: 0.95;
    }
    .content {
      padding: 30px 20px;
    }
    .notice-banner {
      background: #FFFBEB;
      border: 2px solid #FCD34D;
      border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 20px;
      margin: 25px 0;
    }
    .notice-banner h2 {
      margin: 0 0 8px 0;
      font-size: 19px;
      color: #B45309;
    }
    .notice-banner p {
      margin: 0;
      color: #92400E;
      font-size: 15px;
    }
    .member-info {
      background: #F8FAFC;
      border-left: 4px solid #F59E0B;
      padding: 20px;
      margin: 25px 0;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }
    .member-info h3 {
      margin: 0 0 15px 0;
      font-size: 16px;
      color: #1E293B;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .detail-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 10px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
    }
    .detail-row:last-child {
      border-bottom: none;
    }
    .detail-label {
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #64748B;
    }
    .detail-value {
      color: #1E293B;
      font-weight: 500;
    }
    .consents-list {
      background: #FFFBEB;
      border: 1px solid #FDE68A;
      border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 20px;
      margin: 25px 0;
    }
    .consents-list h3 {
      margin: 0 0 15px 0;
      font-size: 16px;
      color: #B45309;
    }
    .consent-item {
      padding: 12px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #FEF3C7;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .consent-item:last-child {
      border-bottom: none;
    }
    .consent-icon {
      font-size: 20px;
      margin-right: 12px;
    }
    .consent-name {
      flex: 1;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #78350F;
    }
    .consent-expires {
      color: #D97706;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .info-box {
      background: #EFF6FF;
      border-left: 4px solid #3B82F6;
      padding: 16px;
      margin: 20px 0;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }
    .info-box p {
      margin: 0;
      color: #1E3A8A;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #F59E0B;
      color: #fff;
      padding: 14px 32px;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin: 20px 0;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .button:hover {
      background: #D97706;
    }
    .button-container {
      text-align: center;
      margin: 30px 0;
    }
    .footer {
      background: #F8FAFC;
      padding: 20px;
      text-align: center;
      color: #64748B;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .footer p {
      margin: 5px 0;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <div class="icon">📝</div>
      <h1>Consent Renewal Required</h1>
      <p>Action needed for continued participation</p>
    </div>

    <div class="content">
      <p>Dear {{parentName}},</p>

      <p>Some of the consents you previously granted for {{memberName}} are due to expire soon. To ensure uninterrupted participation in all club activities, we need you to review and renew these consents.</p>

      <div class="notice-banner">
        <h2>{{expiringCount}} Consent{{#if multipleExpiring}}s{{/if}} Expiring Soon</h2>
        <p>These consents expire {{#if nearestExpiry}}on {{nearestExpiry}}{{else}}within the next 30 days{{/if}}</p>
      </div>

      <div class="member-info">
        <h3>{{memberNoun}} Information</h3>
        <div class="detail-row">
          <span class="detail-label">{{memberNoun}} Name:</span>
          <span class="detail-value">{{memberName}}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="detail-row">
          <span class="detail-label">Date of Birth:</span>
          <span class="detail-value">{{memberDOB}}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="detail-row">
          <span class="detail-label">Current Squad:</span>
          <span class="detail-value">{{squadName}}</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="consents-list">
        <h3>Consents Requiring Renewal</h3>
        {{#each expiringConsents}}
        <div class="consent-item">
          <span class="consent-icon">{{this.icon}}</span>
          <span class="consent-name">{{this.name}}</span>
          <span class="consent-expires">Expires: {{this.expiryDate}}</span>
        </div>
        {{/each}}
      </div>

      <div class="info-box">
        <p><strong>Why do consents expire?</strong> We review consents annually to ensure we have your current preferences and to remain compliant with {{complianceRequirements}}.</p>
      </div>

      <h3 style="color: #1E293B; margin-top: 30px;">What You Need to Do</h3>
      <p>Please log in to your parent portal to review and renew these consents. The process only takes a few minutes:</p>
      <ol style="margin-top: 15px; color: #475569;">
        <li>Log in to your parent portal</li>
        <li>Navigate to "<strong>{{memberName}}</strong>" → "<strong>Consents</strong>"</li>
        <li>Review each expiring consent</li>
        <li>Grant or update your consent preferences</li>
      </ol>

      <div class="button-container">
        <a href="{{consentUrl}}" class="button">Review Consents Now</a>
      </div>

      <p style="margin-top: 30px; background: #FEF2F2; padding: 15px; border-radius: 4px; border-left: 3px solid #F87171;">
        <strong style="color: #991B1B;">Important:</strong> <span style="color: #7F1D1D;">If consents are not renewed by the expiry date, {{memberName}} may not be able to participate in activities covered by those consents until they are updated.</span>
      </p>

      <p style="margin-top: 25px;">If you have any questions about specific consent types or need assistance, please don't hesitate to contact us.</p>

      <p style="margin-top: 20px;">
        Thank you for keeping your consents up to date!<br>
        <strong>{{clubName}} Team</strong>
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      <p>&copy; {{year}} {{clubName}}. All rights reserved.</p>
      <p>This is an automated reminder. Please do not reply to this email.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
